@startuml mushroom-probability
title Readiness Result Clarity Feature Flow

' Purpose: Show the current implemented readiness-result clarity flow for the Mushroom Mood main result card.

actor User
participant "Mushroom Mood UI" as MushroomMoodUi

User -> MushroomMoodUi: Choose spot and species, then request readiness
MushroomMoodUi --> User: Show readiness label, score, confidence, selected spot/species, and timestamp
MushroomMoodUi --> User: Show weather signals, seasonal evidence, species fit, and limitation copy when needed
MushroomMoodUi --> User: Keep the no-guarantee disclaimer visible for every result

@enduml
